# Fast checks only. Anything slower than a couple of seconds here teaches
# people to type --no-verify, and a hook everyone bypasses is worse than none.
#
# Deliberately NOT here: tsc. It cannot be scoped to staged files, it takes
# tens of seconds across six workspaces, and it is the single most common
# reason a team turns hooks off. It runs on pre-push and in CI instead.
npx lint-staged
